msgid "Changelog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:3
msgid "5.2.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:5
#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:11
msgid "Chore: Upgrade `js-yaml` to avoid npm audit warning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:7
msgid "5.2.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:9
msgid ""
"Added: `packageProp` values can be arrays of strings, to allow for "
"property names that include periods. (This was possible before, but not "
"documented or deliberately supported.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:10
msgid ""
"Chore: Replaced the `lodash.get` dependency with a locally defined "
"function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:13
msgid "5.1.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:15
msgid ""
"Added: `packageProp` values can include periods to describe paths to "
"nested objects within `package.json`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:17
msgid "5.0.7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:19
msgid ""
"Fixed: JS loader bypasses Node's `require` cache, fixing a bug where "
"updates to `.js` config files would not load even when Cosmiconfig was "
"told not to cache."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:21
msgid "5.0.6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:23
msgid ""
"Fixed: Better error message if the end user tries an extension "
"Cosmiconfig is not configured to understand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:25
msgid "5.0.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:27
msgid "Fixed: `load` and `loadSync` work with paths relative to `process.cwd()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:29
msgid "5.0.4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:31
msgid ""
"Fixed: `rc` files with `.js` extensions included in default "
"`searchPlaces`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:33
msgid "5.0.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:35
msgid ""
"Docs: Minor corrections to documentation. *Released to update package "
"documentation on npm*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:37
msgid "5.0.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:39
msgid ""
"Fixed: Allow `searchSync` and `loadSync` to load JS configuration files "
"whose export is a Promise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:41
msgid "5.0.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:43
msgid ""
"The API has been completely revamped to increase clarity and enable a "
"very wide range of new usage. **Please read the readme for all the "
"details.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:45
msgid ""
"While the defaults remain just as useful as before — and you can still "
"pass no options at all — now you can also do all kinds of wild and crazy "
"things."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:47
msgid ""
"The `loaders` option allows you specify custom functions to derive config"
" objects from files. Your loader functions could parse ES2015 modules or "
"TypeScript, JSON5, even INI or XML. Whatever suits you."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:48
msgid ""
"The `searchPlaces` option allows you to specify exactly where cosmiconfig"
" looks within each directory it searches."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:49
msgid ""
"The combination of `loaders` and `searchPlaces` means that you should be "
"able to load pretty much any kind of configuration file you want, from "
"wherever you want it to look."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:51
msgid ""
"Additionally, the overloaded `load()` function has been split up into "
"several clear and focused functions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:53
msgid ""
"`search()` now searches up the directory tree, and `load()` loads a "
"configuration file that you don't need to search for."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:54
msgid ""
"The `sync` option has been replaced with separate synchronous functions: "
"`searchSync()` and `loadSync()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:55
msgid ""
"`clearFileCache()` and `clearDirectoryCache()` have been renamed to "
"`clearLoadCache()` and `clearSearchPath()` respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:57
msgid "More details:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:59
msgid ""
"The default JS loader uses `require`, instead of `require-from-string`. "
"So you *could* use `require` hooks to control the loading of JS files "
"(e.g. pass them through esm or Babel). In most cases it is probably "
"preferable to use a custom loader."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:60
msgid ""
"The options `rc`, `js`, and `rcExtensions` have all been removed. You can"
" accomplish the same and more with `searchPlaces`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:61
msgid ""
"The default `searchPlaces` include `rc` files with extensions, e.g. "
"`.thingrc.json`, `.thingrc.yaml`, `.thingrc.yml`. This is the equivalent "
"of switching the default value of the old `rcExtensions` option to "
"`true`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:62
msgid ""
"The option `rcStrictJson` has been removed. To get the same effect, you "
"can specify `noExt: cosmiconfig.loadJson` in your `loaders` object."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:63
msgid ""
"`packageProp` no longer accepts `false`. If you don't want to look in "
"`package.json`, write a `searchPlaces` array that does not include it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:64
msgid ""
"By default, empty files are ignored by `search()`. The new option "
"`ignoreEmptySearchPlaces` allows you to load them, instead, in case you "
"want to do something with empty files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:65
msgid ""
"The option `configPath` has been removed. Just pass your filepaths "
"directory to `load()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:66
msgid ""
"Removed the `format` option.  Formats are now all handled via the file "
"extensions specified in `loaders`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:68
msgid ""
"(If you're wondering with happened to 5.0.0 ... it was a silly publishing"
" mistake.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:70
msgid "4.0.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:72
msgid ""
"Licensing improvement: updated `parse-json` from `3.0.0` to `4.0.0`(see "
"[sindresorhus/parse-json#12][parse-json-pr-12])."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:73
msgid ""
"Changed: error message format for `JSON` parse errors(see "
"[#101][pr-101]). If you were relying on the format of JSON-parsing error "
"messages, this will be a breaking change for you."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_CHANGELOG.md:74
msgid ""
"Changed: set default for `searchPath` as `process.cwd()` in "
"`explorer.load`."
msgstr ""

